  "description": "Deterministic consistent-hashing, rendezvous (HRW) and Maglev routing for sharding and request routing, generic over the caller's key type and a zero-cost inlined Celerity hasher. Fills a literal BCL gap (there is no ConsistentHashRing in .NET) and produces byte-identical shard assignments across runtimes and architectures (x64 / arm64 / Blazor WASM). Part of the Celerity family.",
